Third-party scope
=================

- LICENSES/HOL-Light.txt covers conv.rhm, drule.rhm, algebra.rhm, infinity.rhm,
  wfrec.rhm, treerep.rhm, datatype construction code, and related tests and
  documentation.
- LICENSES/HOL4.txt covers bool.rhm and related base-logic material, plus any
  HOL4-derived well-founded recursion material.
- LICENSES/ACL2.txt covers the automatic prover, including waterfall.rhm,
  goal.rhm, simp.rhm, destruct.rhm, fertilize.rhm, general.rhm,
  irrelevance.rhm, induct.rhm, order.rhm, ruledb.rhm, and ACL2-style hint
  handling in elab.rhm and driver.rhm, plus related tests and documentation.
- LICENSES/QuickCheck.txt covers qc.rhm, datatype generator and shrinker
  emission in module_block.rhm, and related tests and documentation.

These scopes are conservative: they do not assert that every mapped file
contains copyrightable material copied from the named project.
